{"sectionId":"neuro/muscle","items":[{"id":"neuro--muscle-k001","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"골격근 근절은 Z선 사이이며 A대는 굵은 필라멘트 길이, I대는 가는 필라멘트만 있는 영역, H대는 굵은 필라멘트만 있는 영역이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k002","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"수축 시 A대 길이는 거의 일정하고 I대와 H대가 좁아진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k003","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"Ca²⁺가 troponin C에 결합하면 tropomyosin 위치가 바뀌어 actin-myosin 결합이 가능해진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k004","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"ATP 결합은 myosin을 actin에서 떼고 ATP 가수분해는 머리를 준비시키며 Pi 방출이 힘 발생과 연결된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k005","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"골격근에서는 T세관 DHPR과 SR RyR1의 기계적 연계가 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k006","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"심근은 L형 Ca²⁺ 통로로 들어온 Ca²⁺가 RyR2를 활성화하는 calcium-induced calcium release를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k007","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"평활근에서는 Ca²⁺-calmodulin이 MLCK를 활성화하여 myosin 경쇄를 인산화하고 MLCP는 탈인산화한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k008","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"평활근 Ca²⁺ 조절에는 전압·리간드 개폐 통로, IP₃R, SERCA, PMCA, Na⁺/Ca²⁺ 교환체 등이 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k009","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"골격근·심근은 troponin 조절, 평활근은 Ca²⁺-calmodulin–MLCK 조절.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k010","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"SERCA는 Ca²⁺를 SR/ER로 펌프한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k011","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"근절 길이는 감소하지만 필라멘트 자체 길이는 유지된다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k012","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"심근의 긴 불응기는 강축을 막는 데 중요하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"neuro--muscle-k013","sectionId":"neuro/muscle","unitId":"neuro","subject":"biology","text":"myosin에 ATP가 결합해야 actin에서 떨어질 수 있기 때문이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}